#: src/idiomatic/foundations-api-design/meaningful-doc-comments/who-are-you-writing-for.md:56
msgid "Who are you writing for?"
msgstr ""

#: src/idiomatic/foundations-api-design/meaningful-doc-comments/who-are-you-writing-for.md:8
msgid "Colleagues, collaborators, largely-silent API users, or just yourself?"
msgstr ""

